#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:9
#: 2c4c5080dfee449da8b0bff6854c3696
msgid "This article describes how to setup the PX4FLOW (Optical Flow) Sensor which can be used for :ref:`Non-GPS navigation <common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4flow-overview.rst:16
